# Route53 credentials for the stacksjs.com hosted zone, used by the DNS
# reconcile step of a deploy (dnsProviderConfigsFromEnv keys off
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID). Encrypted here so a deploy from CI or a laptop needs no
# exported credentials.
#
# AWS_PROFILE is deliberately NOT set: a profile name that does not exist on a
# runner makes the SDK resolve to that profile and fail, rather than falling
# back to these keys.
#
# Note these are decrypted into the release .env on the box, which is shared
# with other tenants. Scope the IAM policy to this hosted zone.
